{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"因果明确接在H5、H6、H8上，并将“侧身离开”限定为暂时转移注意力，而非新增实际离开或关系变化的外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"想靠近的愿望来自H2，松开后仍有顾虑、失去着力点则由H1、H5、H6、H8支撑，新增的内在纠缠是合理的局部心理过程，没有改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"熟悉的亲近与无法重新握住它来自H2，快乐难以留住来自H7，由此推出珍惜与失落并存，属于已有历史上的局部因果延伸，没有新增往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"对坚定来源的动摇由H4的真实力量与H5、H6的持续用力以及H7的快乐难留共同引出，而且明确没有否定先前在乎的真实性，因此没有改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了当下感受及其心理成因，并用具体的既有经历建立因果联系，合读时“松开之后”“刚才的坚定”等指代也能得到理解，不依赖听感记录才能读懂。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "268ffc32-4c67-4f06-96fb-364f6754b668", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144643113152Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:48:34.574149+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3a6f0c91930fed74a3c265ae9d63acb0e10b5e8425bed4902f02d8d32941dbb3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_n